2. **Fingerprint mechanism: global Sentry event processor.** Verified that `service.Main` owns client creation and offers only an `ExcludeErrors` hook, not a per-client event-processor hook. A `fingerprinter` error type plus `sentry.AddGlobalEventProcessor` is the least invasive way to set `event.Fingerprint` without double-reporting or reordering the existing single capture in `service.Service.Run`. `.golangci.yml` already excludes `SA1019`, so the deprecated global API does not fail lint.
