**R2. `<context>` misdescribes `docs/design.md`.**
`design.md` Part 4 is "Behavior (phases)" and Part 5 is "Data contract & invariants"; neither documents the exit-code contract (no `exit` matches in the file). The exit-code contract is the `exitErrorForStatus` GoDoc in `main.go`.

